WEBVTT

00:01:43.726 --> 00:01:49.892
My name is Yosho, the man who
once deserted Jurai's royal family.

00:01:52.335 --> 00:01:54.503
I am Azaka, a knight of Jurai.

00:01:54.503 --> 00:01:55.938
And I am Kamidake.

00:01:55.938 --> 00:01:59.874
And from now on, we
pledge our allegiance to you.

00:02:26.669 --> 00:02:31.140
This planet is the place where
the Jurai imperial villa used to be.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:32.608
Mmm.

00:02:32.608 --> 00:02:37.944
And it's a perfect spot to hide for a
while from those who are after us, Ayeka.

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:41.471
These are the ruins of dreams past.

00:03:46.916 --> 00:03:52.252
Somehow, that face looks familiar.

00:03:54.824 --> 00:03:57.054
He has gentle eyes.

00:03:59.595 --> 00:04:02.865
Aha! His eyes look just like yours, Tenchi.

00:04:02.865 --> 00:04:06.068
Huh? You think so?

00:04:06.068 --> 00:04:08.437
- That's the legendary warrior Yosho.
- Huh?

00:04:08.437 --> 00:04:10.573
That's the statue of Yosho.

00:04:10.573 --> 00:04:13.542
What?! So that's you
when you were young, father?

00:04:13.542 --> 00:04:16.912
You sure were handsome. Wow!

00:04:16.912 --> 00:04:18.881
Huh?

00:04:18.881 --> 00:04:21.450
So that's Grandpa.

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:25.079
Look. It looks like there used
to be another statue over there.

00:04:27.923 --> 00:04:31.026
Yeah! I wonder who it was.

00:04:31.026 --> 00:04:33.729
Huh? I don't really know, Sasami.

00:04:33.729 --> 00:04:38.496
That used to be a statue of a man
with the most amazing potential.

00:04:46.442 --> 00:04:50.146
He was of noble birth, his family
tree being that of Jurai's royal family.

00:04:50.146 --> 00:04:57.245
He was extraordinarily gifted,
both in swordsmanship and academics.

00:05:19.074 --> 00:05:21.443
He was a wonderful man.

00:05:21.443 --> 00:05:26.813
And it would have been he who
was praised as the legendary warrior...

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:36.055
...if only he had not allowed himself to
be changed so much by the Jurai power.

00:05:37.193 --> 00:05:39.228
The incredible power that
belongs to Jurai's royal family,

00:05:39.228 --> 00:05:40.930
the dominator of all galaxies.

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:47.335
The secret behind the family's absolute
strength lies in this Jurai power...

00:05:50.539 --> 00:05:57.012
...the mysterious power given by the god,
the mightiest power in the universe

00:05:57.012 --> 00:05:59.515
that denies any elucidation
by human intelligence.

00:05:59.515 --> 00:06:03.144
That is the Jurai power.

00:06:06.088 --> 00:06:10.320
The man became fascinated
and obsessed with the power.

00:06:12.228 --> 00:06:16.961
He became a prisoner of it the power
being far too immense for him to resist.

00:06:19.902 --> 00:06:24.430
And there was nothing
that could stop his ambition.

00:06:51.967 --> 00:06:56.028
And then I battled with him and won.

00:06:58.774 --> 00:07:01.844
After that, he vanished
into the darkness of space,

00:07:01.844 --> 00:07:05.610
his name erased from Jurai's history.

00:07:08.751 --> 00:07:13.922
It was then I decided to
leave Jurai never to return.

00:07:13.922 --> 00:07:16.550
So that's the identity of our enemy.

00:07:19.028 --> 00:07:21.496
Even though there is no proof...

00:07:23.232 --> 00:07:25.097
Kagato...

00:07:34.743 --> 00:07:36.712
Of course, I had no idea.

00:07:36.712 --> 00:07:40.149
I never knew anything
happened like that on Jurai.

00:07:40.149 --> 00:07:44.019
Well, I don't think Ayeka knew
either, Sasami. She's kinda shaken.

00:07:44.019 --> 00:07:48.090
Here's your dinner, everyone!
Thanks for waiting!

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.426
What?! More carrots?!

00:07:50.426 --> 00:07:54.697
Afraid so. It's the only food left, Washu.

00:07:54.697 --> 00:07:58.267
I bought too many carrots.
What are ya gonna do? Life is like that.

00:07:58.267 --> 00:08:01.794
I know Ryo-Ohki loves 'em...

00:08:03.539 --> 00:08:06.008
Oh! That reminds me. Where is Ryo-Ohki?

00:08:06.008 --> 00:08:07.276
Hmm?

00:08:07.276 --> 00:08:11.180
Yeah. Where is she? She's probably
just playing around somewhere.

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:14.016
Ya know, I gotta say I kinda like
havin' dinner under the stars like this.

00:08:14.016 --> 00:08:15.984
Don't you guys?

00:08:15.984 --> 00:08:18.253
Yeah! This is like camping.

00:08:18.253 --> 00:08:22.157
Hey, do you think we
should go get Tenchi and Ayeka?

00:08:22.157 --> 00:08:25.718
Mihoshi, I think we should
just leave them alone for now.

00:08:26.729 --> 00:08:28.063
You're probably right.

00:08:28.063 --> 00:08:30.632
Hey, come on! Pay attention!
The fire's goin' out!

00:08:30.632 --> 00:08:32.532
Ooh! No!

00:08:35.404 --> 00:08:37.668
I really wish they'd cook faster.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:40.030
Huh?

00:09:03.866 --> 00:09:05.527
Tenchi?

00:09:07.102 --> 00:09:08.592
Ayeka.

00:09:09.872 --> 00:09:13.273
You seem very lost in thought.
What are you thinking about?

00:09:18.347 --> 00:09:22.351
You're thinking about
your royal blood, aren't you?

00:09:22.351 --> 00:09:26.488
I don't know. It's just so strange.

00:09:26.488 --> 00:09:28.624
Only a while ago, I was just
an ordinary Earthling, ya know?

00:09:28.624 --> 00:09:32.327
Just an ordinary high
school boy and nothing more.

00:09:32.327 --> 00:09:34.727
Then, all of a sudden, I don't know...

00:09:35.864 --> 00:09:38.901
Tenchi, I know it's difficult,
but I've enjoyed it all.

00:09:38.901 --> 00:09:40.235
Huh?

00:09:40.235 --> 00:09:43.605
From the time we left the
Earth chased by the Jurai forces...

00:09:43.605 --> 00:09:48.010
in fact, ever since I arrived on the Earth
and started to live with you and your family...

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:52.003
I have been so very happy
enjoying every minute of life.

00:09:53.015 --> 00:09:57.286
But I have always understood my duty
as the first princess of the planet Jurai.

00:09:57.286 --> 00:10:02.357
And of course I knew that my happy holiday
would have to come to an end one day.

00:10:02.357 --> 00:10:08.063
And, yes, I always knew I would eventually
have to say good-bye to you, Tenchi.

00:10:08.063 --> 00:10:09.865
Ayeka...

00:10:09.865 --> 00:10:13.135
Please listen, Tenchi!
Even though I am the first princess...

00:10:13.135 --> 00:10:17.406
I am merely a member of
one of many branch families.

00:10:17.406 --> 00:10:20.843
Now that it has been revealed
you are the direct descendant

00:10:20.843 --> 00:10:24.213
of Jurai's royal family, it is you,
Tenchi, who should succeed the throne.

00:10:24.213 --> 00:10:26.181
But, Ayeka, l...

00:10:30.118 --> 00:10:36.182
If you do so, Tenchi, I can be near you.
Tenchi, I can be close to you always.

00:10:39.561 --> 00:10:44.333
And the wish I've always had, the wish I'd
thought was impossible, might come true.

00:10:44.333 --> 00:10:47.461
L-I can't help thinking that, Tenchi.

00:10:48.804 --> 00:10:52.069
Forgive me... for pouring out my heart.

00:11:27.609 --> 00:11:31.246
I knew you would come, Yosho.

00:11:31.246 --> 00:11:36.084
Yes, I was certain you
would come here, Yosho.

00:11:36.084 --> 00:11:39.383
And so it was you all along, Kagato.

00:12:07.215 --> 00:12:12.821
I've waited so long for this
moment to meet you again.

00:12:12.821 --> 00:12:16.158
Of course I wasn't dead, but you knew that.

00:12:16.158 --> 00:12:19.928
All this time, I was in the
darkness of the universe

00:12:19.928 --> 00:12:22.598
refining and strengthening my
Jurai power to the most extreme limit.

00:12:22.598 --> 00:12:29.003
I've been thinking of you for a long, long time.

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:38.174
I must say, it's very nice to see you again.

00:12:41.883 --> 00:12:45.587
I see you've aged, eh, Yosho?

00:12:45.587 --> 00:12:48.523
I think I look pretty good for my age.

00:12:48.523 --> 00:12:50.125
Just look at me.

00:12:50.125 --> 00:12:53.261
The infinite power of youth
is completely mine to command.

00:12:53.261 --> 00:12:57.199
Is that one of the powers you acquired
in the darkness of the universe?

00:12:57.199 --> 00:12:58.634
Indeed, it is.

00:12:58.634 --> 00:13:02.437
There is nothing Jurai's power cannot do.

00:13:02.437 --> 00:13:06.464
So you've had a universal
facelift, is that it, Kagato?

00:13:10.679 --> 00:13:12.306
Are you ready?

00:13:26.828 --> 00:13:30.899
That's good. I can feel
your fighting spirit now.

00:13:30.899 --> 00:13:35.237
Kagato, I have to make
you die once again, you know.

00:13:35.237 --> 00:13:38.507
As the heir to the throne of
planet Jurai will your power win,

00:13:38.507 --> 00:13:43.578
or will my power triumph amplified
by the darkness of the universe?

00:13:43.578 --> 00:13:45.546
We shall see.

00:13:50.352 --> 00:13:51.979
Take this.

00:14:00.395 --> 00:14:04.456
You're still... quite good.

00:14:05.634 --> 00:14:08.660
You're exactly like the old days,
but I'm not exactly like the old days.

00:14:12.974 --> 00:14:18.037
Well, well. That's very impressive, Yosho.
Worthy of a legendary warrior.

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.289
I did warn you...

00:14:27.289 --> 00:14:30.325
I am not the same as the old days.

00:14:30.325 --> 00:14:32.260
I can see that.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:38.100
In the darkness of the universe fighting a
fear and desperation worse than death itself

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:43.902
I would dream of this moment over and over,
dream of the moment I killed you, Yosho.

00:15:06.995 --> 00:15:08.986
Kagato...

00:15:12.634 --> 00:15:14.966
Kagato...

00:15:20.408 --> 00:15:25.147
...at the time I slew you, I killed
myself as well. And now again.

00:15:25.147 --> 00:15:29.675
Why must I face you in battle once again?

00:15:42.364 --> 00:15:44.696
Forgive me, Kagato.

00:15:48.236 --> 00:15:49.897
Huh?

00:15:55.343 --> 00:15:57.045
Interesting.

00:15:57.045 --> 00:16:00.139
You want us to kill each other
at the same time, don't you?

00:16:10.325 --> 00:16:12.360
What was that?!

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:15.630
It's a tremendous energy, very close.

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:17.098
The Jurai power?

00:16:17.098 --> 00:16:18.827
Probably. Yes.

00:16:27.576 --> 00:16:29.711
Grandpa...

00:16:29.711 --> 00:16:31.446
Hurry, Kamidake.

00:16:31.446 --> 00:16:32.936
Right!

00:16:37.786 --> 00:16:39.621
Well, that's too bad.

00:16:39.621 --> 00:16:42.954
Looks like you're the only one to die today.

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:48.196
Why don't you go and visit hell this time?

00:16:48.196 --> 00:16:50.498
You can go and take my place!

00:16:50.498 --> 00:16:52.056
Huh?

00:16:55.437 --> 00:16:57.572
You there, who are you?

00:16:57.572 --> 00:16:59.207
Jurai's emperor and king!

00:16:59.207 --> 00:17:00.442
You're not!

00:17:00.442 --> 00:17:04.579
Yes. The mightiest and
last of all the Jurai kings.

00:17:04.579 --> 00:17:06.414
That's who I am!

00:17:06.414 --> 00:17:09.474
We'll see about that!

00:17:11.319 --> 00:17:12.988
Huh? What?

00:17:12.988 --> 00:17:16.491
You're fun to play with,
but I'm very busy right now.

00:17:16.491 --> 00:17:18.220
Get lost.

00:17:32.741 --> 00:17:34.766
Ryoko!

00:17:36.278 --> 00:17:38.346
Ryoko...?

00:17:38.346 --> 00:17:40.041
Grandpa!

00:17:41.349 --> 00:17:43.518
You watch out, Tenchi.

00:17:43.518 --> 00:17:46.655
This guy's no one to mess with.

00:17:46.655 --> 00:17:48.356
Princess Ayeka.

00:17:48.356 --> 00:17:49.755
Huh?

00:17:51.026 --> 00:17:52.494
I'm glad you're here.

00:17:52.494 --> 00:17:56.398
You're just in time to witness
the legendary warrior's destruction.

00:17:56.398 --> 00:17:57.933
Not so fast.

00:17:57.933 --> 00:17:59.423
Hmm?

00:18:01.002 --> 00:18:04.096
You will have to destroy us first, Kagato.

00:18:06.141 --> 00:18:09.133
Begone, you fools!

00:18:11.313 --> 00:18:13.247
Azaka! Kamidake!

00:18:20.522 --> 00:18:23.458
You will have to fight me now!

00:18:23.458 --> 00:18:25.187
Silly boy.

00:18:29.698 --> 00:18:31.900
I see.

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:34.664
You must stay back, Tenchi.

00:18:40.875 --> 00:18:42.944
We'll take it from here!

00:18:42.944 --> 00:18:48.216
Well, my boy, why don't you and
I choose another time and place to meet?

00:18:48.216 --> 00:18:50.150
What?!

00:19:09.871 --> 00:19:11.506
Ayeka!

00:19:11.506 --> 00:19:14.642
Tenchi!

00:19:14.642 --> 00:19:16.974
Ayeka!

00:19:17.212 --> 00:19:20.949
Tenchi! Help me!

00:19:20.949 --> 00:19:22.644
Oh, no!

00:19:25.053 --> 00:19:28.023
Come back, Ayeka!

00:19:28.023 --> 00:19:31.659
I will be waiting for you at the Jurai palace.

00:19:31.659 --> 00:19:34.696
And I wish you luck
getting there in one piece.

00:19:34.696 --> 00:19:37.130
You won't get away!

00:19:58.787 --> 00:20:00.812
Ah... treacherous coward!

00:20:03.525 --> 00:20:05.760
Please, Grandpa...

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.660
Grandpa, hang on.

00:20:12.133 --> 00:20:14.169
Please, Grandpa, you must live!

00:20:14.169 --> 00:20:15.703
Quickly! We have to help him!

00:20:15.703 --> 00:20:17.193
Gotcha!

00:20:21.142 --> 00:20:24.412
Here, Tenchi... take this.

00:20:24.412 --> 00:20:26.714
What is it, Grandpa?

00:20:26.714 --> 00:20:28.149
Sword Tenchi.

00:20:28.149 --> 00:20:33.121
The magical sword that transforms
Jurai's power into a blade.

00:20:33.121 --> 00:20:34.956
Sword Tenchi?

00:20:34.956 --> 00:20:40.428
Tenchi, you are the only
one who can destroy Kagato.

00:20:40.428 --> 00:20:42.230
Go, Tenchi.

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:44.892
It is all up to you now.

00:22:53.261 --> 00:22:55.296
Tenchi, you should choose me!

00:22:55.296 --> 00:22:57.799
Forget Ayeka.

00:22:57.799 --> 00:22:59.133
What?

00:22:59.133 --> 00:23:01.135
Don't go, Tenchi.

00:23:01.135 --> 00:23:02.136
Please!

00:23:02.136 --> 00:23:04.239
I beg you.

00:23:04.239 --> 00:23:05.406
Ryoko.

00:23:05.406 --> 00:23:07.475
I don't need anything else.

00:23:07.475 --> 00:23:12.947
I just can't bear the thought of losing you.

00:23:12.947 --> 00:23:15.516
Next episode is: "No Need for Ryoko!"

00:23:15.516 --> 00:23:19.213
It's unquestionably true love.
